  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable management of agro-biodiversity and vulnerable ecosystems recuperation in Peruvian Andean regions through Globally Important Agricultural Heritage Systems (GIAHS) approach.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to conserve in-situ and to sustainably use globally-important agro-biodiversity (ABD) through the preservation of traditional agricultural systems, the integrated management of forests, water, and land resources, and the maintenance of ecosystem services</narrative>
  </description>
